1.13.0 Release notes (2026-09-03)
================================

Improvements to the 'RingPublishingTracking' module.

### Changes

* Added optional 'viewType' field to the 'RDLC' parameter, reported with content page view event
    - new public 'ContentViewType' enum with 'text', 'video', 'tts' and 'audio' values
    - reporting a page view which is not article content clears the previously reported view type
    - 'RDLC' stays unchanged for hosts which do not report a view type
* Added 'shouldTrackContentKeepAlive' configuration flag, enabled by default
    - when disabled, reporting content page view does not start keep alive tracking
    - 'contentKeepAliveDataSource' parameter is now optional, without a default value, so a new call site has to decide explicitly
    - when keep alive tracking is skipped, measurement of the previously reported content is stopped
    - disabling keep alive also disables automatic effective page view reporting, which is driven by keep alive measurements
